# Google Sheet that holds all dropdown values for the Add Resume form.
# 1. Create a Google Sheet, tab named "Options", headers: Category | Group | Value | Label
#    (import public/options-template.csv to get started)
# 2. File -> Share -> Publish to web -> Publish
# 3. Copy the ID from the sheet URL:
#    https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/THIS_PART/edit
# 4. Set it below (local dev) and in Render -> Environment (production).
VITE_OPTIONS_SHEET_ID=
